stream
BT /F1 16 Tf 72 720 Td (The Agent Compliance Playbook) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 698 Td (7 patterns for adding OFAC sanctions screening to your AI agent's payment path) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 684 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 670 Td (Pattern 1: Screen-Before-Sign) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 652 Td (The single rule that prevents 100% of sanctioned-wallet payments.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 638 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 624 Td (The problem:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 610 Td (Your agent decides to pay, signs the tx, then screens. By then it is too late) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 596 Td (? the tx is on-chain.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 582 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 568 Td (The pattern:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 554 Td (Call sanctions_check BEFORE the signing step, in the same code path that) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 540 Td (authorises payment. Treat the screen as a hard gate, not a log line.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 526 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 512 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 498 Td (if not sanctions_check\(wallet=to_addr\).get\('clean'\):) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 484 Td (    abort\('blocked: OFAC SDN match'\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 470 Td (sign_tx\(to_addr, amount\)  # only reached if clean) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 452 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 438 Td (Pattern 2: The 100ms Budget) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 420 Td (Compliance that costs more than one network hop gets ripped out in week two.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 406 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 392 Td (The problem:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 378 Td (A 900ms screening call blocks the payment path, an engineer removes it, and) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 364 Td (you are unscreened again.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 350 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 336 Td (The pattern:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 322 Td (Enforce a hard latency budget. agentmail returns in <100ms p95; fail closed) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 308 Td (only if the call exceeds 500ms \(configurable\). Cache clean results for 60s to) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 294 Td (coalesce bursts.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 280 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 266 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 252 Td (result = sanctions_check\(wallet=w, timeout=0.5\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 238 Td (if result is None:          # timed out) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 224 Td (    return 'review'          # do NOT auto-allow on timeout) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 206 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 192 Td (Pattern 3: Risk-Score the Amount, Not Just the Wallet) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 174 Td (A clean wallet moving $50k on day one is not the same as one moving $5.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 160 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 146 Td (The problem:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 132 Td (You screen the wallet, it is clean, you allow ? and miss that a clean wallet) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 118 Td (is being used as a mule for a sanctioned actor.) Tj ET

endstream
endobj
