stream
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 720 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 706 Td (The pattern:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 692 Td (Layer risk_score on top of sanctions_check. It weighs amount anomalies, rail) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 678 Td (\(x402/AP2/ACP\), wallet age, and category exposure into a 0-100 score with an) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 664 Td (explicit allow/review/decline recommendation.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 650 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 636 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 622 Td (r = risk_score\(counterparty=w, amount=amt, rail='x402'\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 608 Td (if r['recommendation'] == 'decline':) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 594 Td (    return block_with_reason\(r['reasons']\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 576 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 562 Td (Pattern 4: Know Your Agent \(KYA\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 544 Td (The counterparty is another agent. Who vouches for it?) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 530 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 516 Td (The problem:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 502 Td (Two agents transact and neither knows the other's operator. There is no KYC) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 488 Td (analogue for agents.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 474 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 460 Td (The pattern:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 446 Td (Before trusting a counterparty agent, call kya_verify with its wallet age, on-) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 432 Td (chain history, and domain. It returns a trust score and flags \(fresh wallet,) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 418 Td (no history, sanctioned-adjacent\).) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 404 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 390 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 376 Td (k = kya_verify\(agent_id=peer, wallet=peer_w,) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 362 Td (               wallet_age_days=age, domain=peer_domain\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 348 Td (if k['trust_score'] < 40:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 334 Td (    require_human_approval\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 316 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 302 Td (Pattern 5: The Audit Trail Is the Product) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 284 Td (Regulators do not ask 'did it work.' They ask 'prove it worked, for every tx,) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 270 Td (for 5 years.') Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 256 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 242 Td (The problem:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 228 Td (You screened, but you have no timestamped, tamper-evident record. A regulator) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 214 Td (asks for proof and you cannot produce it.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 200 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 186 Td (The pattern:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 172 Td (Log every screen: the wallet, the timestamp, the result, the list version.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 158 Td (agentmail's hosted tier writes a tamper-evident audit log you can export.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 144 Td (Self-hosters should append to a write-once store.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 130 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 116 Td (Example:) Tj ET

endstream
