BT /F3 9 Tf 80 720 Td (# every screen becomes an append-only row) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 706 Td (audit.append\(ts=now, wallet=w, result=r,) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 692 Td (             list_version=sdn_version, hash=prev_hash\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 674 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 660 Td (Pattern 6: Dispute-First, Not Litigate-First) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 642 Td (When a payment goes wrong, a 7-day auto-escalation beats a 7-month legal) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 628 Td (fight.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 614 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 600 Td (The problem:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 586 Td (A bad payment happens and you have no structured way to contest, freeze, or) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 572 Td (recover. It becomes a lawsuit.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 558 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 544 Td (The pattern:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 530 Td (Call dispute_open the moment a paid transaction is flagged. It opens a) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 516 Td (structured dispute with a 7-day auto-escalation timer and a full evidence) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 502 Td (trail attached.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 488 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 474 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 460 Td (dispute_open\(transaction_id=txid,) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 446 Td (             reason='post-payment SDN match'\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 80 432 Td (# auto-escalates at day 7 if unresolved) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 414 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 400 Td (Pattern 7: Fail Closed, Degrade Loudly) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 382 Td (Silent failure is worse than no screening ? it gives you false confidence.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 368 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 354 Td (The problem:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 340 Td (The screening API goes down, your agent catches the exception and pays anyway,) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 326 Td (and you do not find out until the fine.) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 312 Td () Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 298 Td (The pattern:) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 284 Td (On provider failure: \(a\) fail CLOSED for high-value txs, \(b\) fail OPEN only) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 270 Td (with explicit operator policy, and \(c\) ALWAYS emit a 'degraded' signal so you) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 256 Td (know screening is running on stale data. agentmail's /health and) Tj ET
BT /F3 11 Tf 72 242 Td (/compliance/status report this.) Tj ET
